before:
Complete local PHP example; the app itself does not execute it:
```php
<?php
declare(strict_types=1);
class Account {
    private int $amount = 0;
    public function deposit(int $value): void {
        if ($value < 0) { throw new InvalidArgumentException('negative'); }
        $this->amount += $value;
    }
    public function balance(): int { return $this->amount; }
}
$account = new Account();
$account->deposit(5);
echo $account->balance(), "\n";
```

